    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/a11a6133d11502126549a5b3cf1fcb83.poster.avif?t=1714953547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/a11a6133d11502126549a5b3cf1fcb83.webm?t=1714953547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/a11a6133d11502126549a5b3cf1fcb83.mp4?t=1714953547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You are a weapon genius. You know everything about the gun mechanisms, ballistics, shooting skills and other.  You must create ever better and improved guns and earn money through accurate shooting. <br><br><br>Select and buy the necessary details in order to combine the weapon properties and achieve the maximal performance of fire efficiency. <br>Create a gun of your dream!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/4f73bce3f49171f30582ae5a0179b143.poster.avif?t=1714953547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/4f73bce3f49171f30582ae5a0179b143.webm?t=1714953547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/4f73bce3f49171f30582ae5a0179b143.mp4?t=1714953547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/a11a6133d11502126549a5b3cf1fcb83.poster.avif?t=1714953547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/a11a6133d11502126549a5b3cf1fcb83.webm?t=1714953547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/a11a6133d11502126549a5b3cf1fcb83.mp4?t=1714953547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You are a weapon genius. You know everything about the gun mechanisms, ballistics, shooting skills and other.  You must create ever better and improved guns and earn money through accurate shooting. <br><br><br>Select and buy the necessary details in order to combine the weapon properties and achieve the maximal performance of fire efficiency. <br>Create a gun of your dream!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/4f73bce3f49171f30582ae5a0179b143.poster.avif?t=1714953547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/4f73bce3f49171f30582ae5a0179b143.webm?t=1714953547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1273380/extras/4f73bce3f49171f30582ae5a0179b143.mp4?t=1714953547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
